filenumber 632897
! STAGE 9 -- raise kpmax on the one configuration that matches the front.
! Built from res632875.in; only kpmax and the map's disc value change.
!
! 632875 is the only run of 70 whose front matches (lambda 1.03), but its
! wellhead is +80%. 28 runs match the wellhead and 24 of those barely slip.
! Nothing matches both, because every lever tried so far moves both targets.
!
! kpmax does not. From 632812 vs 632818, which differ mainly in kpmax:
!   632812  kpmax 2.5e-13   peak above plateau  6.37 MPa   R 235 m   +70.7%
!   632818  kpmax 5.0e-14   peak above plateau 31.90 MPa   R 250 m   +309%
! The front moves 6% while the wellhead moves 4.4x, and the peak scales as
! 1/kpmax exactly as deltaP = q*eta/(4*pi*kpmax) predicts. The front is set
! by volume balance into the sealed disc (phi*beta and dp_crit, NOT kpmax);
! the wellhead is a plateau pinned near dp_crit PLUS a peak going as 1/kpmax.
!
! kpmax 2.5e-13 -> 2.5e-11 (100x). Predicted peak above
! plateau 0.068 MPa against 632875's 6.81, so dp(r_w)
! 12.22 MPa against a measured 10.92, and a wellhead
! bias of roughly +3 to +4%. The front should be unchanged at ~1.03.
!
! CONSISTENCY: the near-well disc IS kpmax and the background IS kp = kpmin.
! permphi_2zone_601_ds5_kmax2.5e-11_G3.txt therefore has its 2821-cell disc raised to 2.5e-11 while
! kp and kpmin stay at 1.0e-15. The G3 phi grading and every other
! value are copied from the parent unchanged.
!
! Domain: the far field stays at kpmin, D = 2.50e-03 m^2/s, so the 5 d
! diffusion length is 66 m against a 1502 m
! half-domain. Inside the disc D is large but the disc is bounded by the
! unslipped kpmin region.
!
! gamma = 0.00169 at h = 60 s, against 632875's 0.14 -- a high kpmax makes
! the Peaceman well WELL damped, so this should integrate more easily than
! the parent, not less.
problem 3dp
imax 601
jmax 601
ds 0.005
interval 30
nstep 40000
tmax 0.01369863
dtmax 43200
dtout 0.0002
parameterfromfile T
parameter_file "permphi_2zone_601_ds5_kmax2.5e-11_G3.txt"
parameter_file_ncol 2
backslip T
vpl 0d0
a 0.015
b 0.012
dc 1e-4
f0 0.6
muinit 0.37
sigmainit 27.99
velinit 1d-12
limitsigma T
minsig 1
velmin 1d-20
pressurediffusion T
permev T
kpmax 2.5e-11
kpmin 1e-15
kp 1e-15
phi 0.01
beta 2.25e-8
eta 0.89e-3
kL 1e-3
kT 1e15
pfinit 0d0
bcl Dirichlet
bcr Dirichlet
bct Dirichlet
bcb Dirichlet
pbcl 0d0
pbcr 0d0
pbct 0d0
pbcb 0d0
injectionfromfile T
injection_file "june_clean.txt"
rigid 24
Sw_fwid 7.4e-9
rw 8.9e-2
